PolyForm Shield License 1.0.0
==============================

*** ACTION REQUIRED BEFORE PUBLISHING ***

This file is a placeholder. Populate it with the official, verbatim license
text before you push this repo publicly — do not hand-write or paraphrase a
license; use the canonical source so the legal text is exact.

Run this once, from the repo root:

    curl -o LICENSE https://polyformproject.org/licenses/shield/1.0.0.txt

That will overwrite this placeholder with the authoritative text and fill in
the bracketed [name of licensor] field for you to complete.

Why PolyForm Shield 1.0.0:
  - Free to use, modify, and redistribute for any purpose — including
    running it internally at a for-profit employer — EXCEPT to build a
    competing product or service.
  - Keeps the door open for you to commercialize this yourself later
    (a dual-license / "open core" model) without another party legally
    forking it into a competing hosted offering first.
  - It's a standardized, lawyer-drafted license text (not a custom EULA),
    which makes it easier for others to evaluate and trust.

Reference: https://polyformproject.org/licenses/shield/1.0.0/
